      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes you can do `atest avatar`. More information can be found at go/avatar-android but basically:\n\n`atest avatar` runs all the tests.\n`atest avatar:\u003cClassName\u003e#\u003cTestName\u003e` runs a specific tests, e.g:\n`atest avatar:SdpTest#test_sdp_connect_and_disconnect`\n\nYou can add `-v` for verbose",
